      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it does define me though. it's not just a mistake, it's who i am. i look in the mirror and i just see this emptiness. i don't think i even deserve to be here. like, why should someone as hollow as me get to take up space and breathe and live a life when i couldn't even do the bare minimum when it mattered?",
